Package: jarvis-pkg
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: jarvis-helper (= @VERSION@), apt, flatpak
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mmAbdelhay/jarvis
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ package tools (MCP server)
 Package search, info and install/remove requests across APT and Flathub,
 and disk usage, for the Jarvis agent. Installs and removals are carried out
 by jarvis-helper after the user approves them.
